{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "```python\ndef fibfib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the n-th element of the fibfib number sequence efficiently using dynamic programming.\n    Handles base cases and iteratively calculates subsequent values.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 1\n\n    # Initialize a list to store fibfib numbers, similar to a cache\n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    dp[1] = 0\n    dp[2] = 1\n\n    # Calculate fibfib(i) for i from 3 to n\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        dp[i] = dp[i-1] + dp[i-2] + dp[i-3]\n\n    return dp[n]\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/63", "solution": "def fibfib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Computes the n-th FibFib number using an efficient iterative approach.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0 or n == 1:\n        return 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 1\n\n    a, b, c = 0, 0, 1  # Corresponds to fibfib(0), fibfib(1), fibfib(2)\n    for _ in range(3, n + 1):\n        next_fibfib = a + b + c\n        a = b\n        b = c\n        c = next_fibfib\n    return c"}
