{"task_id": "HumanEval/70", "solution": "def strange_sort_list(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts a list of integers in a strange order: min, then max of remaining, then min, and so on.\n    Handles an empty list by returning an empty list.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not lst:\n        return []\n\n    sorted_lst = sorted(lst)\n    result = []\n    left = 0\n    right = len(sorted_lst) - 1\n    is_min_turn = True\n\n    while left <= right:\n        if is_min_turn:\n            result.append(sorted_lst[left])\n            left += 1\n        else:\n            result.append(sorted_lst[right])\n            right -= 1\n        is_min_turn = not is_min_turn\n\n    return result"}
